<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-PT">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{% block title %}{{ brand.name }}{% endblock %}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{% block description %}Promoções de voos baratos desde Lisboa e Porto, com preços verificados e datas reais.{% endblock %}">
{% if canonical %}<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.base_url }}{{ canonical }}">{% endif %}
{% block robots %}{% endblock %}
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ brand.name }}">
<meta property="og:locale" content="pt_PT">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ self.title() }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ self.description() }}">
{% if canonical %}<meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.base_url }}{{ canonical }}">{% endif %}
{% block og_image %}{% endblock %}
<meta name="theme-color" content="#FF6B4A">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #fbfaf7; --surface: #ffffff; --ink: #1b1a17; --muted: #66645e; --line: #e7e4dc;
  --accent: #e2553a; --accent-ink: #ffffff; --sun: #b77900; --tag: #fff1d6;
  --ok: #1f7a4d; --ok-bg: #e4f3ea; --bad: #b3261e; --bad-bg: #fbe8e6;
  --radius: 16px; --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.05), 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
  --display: "Bahnschrift", "DIN Alternate", "Arial Narrow", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --text: "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root { --bg: #131312; --surface: #1d1d1b; --ink: #f3f1ec; --muted: #a8a59d; --line: #33312d;
    --accent: #ff7a5c; --accent-ink: #1b0e0a; --sun: #ffcf5a; --tag: #3a2c0c;
    --ok: #74d6a4; --ok-bg: #15301f; --bad: #ff9389; --bad-bg: #3b1916; --shadow: none; }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font: 16px/1.55 var(--text); }
a { color: var(--accent); }
img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
.wrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }
header.site { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
header.site .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; min-height: 60px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font: 700 19px var(--display); }
.brand svg { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: none; }
nav.main { display: flex; gap: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
nav.main a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 10px; }
nav.main a:hover, nav.main a[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg); }
main { padding: 28px 0 56px; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-family: var(--display); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 44px); margin: 0 0 10px; }
h2 { font-size: clamp(22px, 4.5vw, 28px); margin: 40px 0 14px; }
.lead { font-size: 18px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 680px; margin: 0; }
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow); display: flex; flex-direction: column; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
.card .img { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; background: var(--line); }
.card .img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }  /* parent fixes 4:5 */
.card .body { padding: 14px 16px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
.card .route { font: 700 18px var(--display); }
.card .price { font: 800 26px var(--display); letter-spacing: -.5px; }
.card .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
.tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--tag); color: var(--sun); align-self: flex-start; }
.btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 48px; padding: 12px 22px;
  border-radius: 12px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; text-decoration: none; }
.btn:hover { filter: brightness(1.05); }
.notice { border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; margin: 14px 0; }
.notice.bad { background: var(--bad-bg); color: var(--bad); }
.notice.ok { background: var(--ok-bg); color: var(--ok); }
.empty { background: var(--surface); border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px; color: var(--muted); }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; background: var(--surface); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
th { font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .4px; color: var(--muted); }
td.num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 700; }
.list-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 0; margin: 0; list-style: none; }
.list-links a { display: inline-block; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
.prose { max-width: 720px; }
.prose p, .prose li { color: var(--ink); }
footer.site { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; padding: 24px 0 36px; }
footer.site p { margin: 6px 0; max-width: 760px; }
{% block style %}{% endblock %}
</style>
{% if site.analytics_token %}<script defer src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js" data-cf-beacon='{"token": "{{ site.analytics_token }}"}'></script>{% endif %}
</head>
<body>
<header class="site">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="{{ brand.name }}: início">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="#FF6B4A"/><path d="M14 36 L48 20 L44 26 L52 28 L46 32 L40 30 L26 42 L24 38 L20 40 Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
      {{ brand.name }}
    </a>
    <nav class="main" aria-label="Principal">
      <a href="/" {% if canonical == "/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Promoções</a>
      <a href="/#rotas">Rotas</a>
      <a href="/sobre/" {% if canonical == "/sobre/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Como funciona</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<main>
  <div class="wrap">
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
  </div>
</main>
<footer class="site">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p><strong>Publicidade:</strong> alguns links deste site são links de afiliado. Se reservares através deles, podemos receber uma pequena comissão, sem custo extra para ti. Não vendemos bilhetes: a reserva é feita no site parceiro.</p>
    <p>Os preços mudam muito depressa. Cada promoção indica quando o preço foi encontrado e verificado; confirma sempre o preço final antes de pagar.</p>
    <p><a href="/sobre/">Como funciona</a> · <a href="/privacidade/">Privacidade</a> · <a href="{{ brand.instagram_url }}" rel="noopener">Instagram {{ brand.handle }}</a> · Atualizado a {{ built_at }}</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
